1.0.4, first of all,

00:41:21.250 --> 00:41:22.960
becomes prod, the new prod.

00:41:22.960 --> 00:41:24.680
And then 100% of the
traffic goes there.

00:41:27.869 --> 00:41:29.410
Of course, that one
is the one that's

00:41:29.410 --> 00:41:30.880
