was we had 1.0.3 as prod.

00:41:40.740 --> 00:41:43.050
Then we had 1.0.4 as canary.

00:41:43.050 --> 00:41:46.000
And now we have 1.0.4 as prod.

00:41:46.000 --> 00:41:49.060
So just using Spinnaker
and Istio and Kubernetes

00:41:49.060 --> 00:41:51.400
